    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_language_d_select_01",
      "hash64": "4C9EA760060359BA",
      "text": "Wie wäre es hier?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_language_d_select_02",
      "hash64": "4C9EA66006035807",
      "text": "Bei Ihnen, Señor Salvatore!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "kizuna_language_d_08a",
      "hash64": "F9F39B0FC766334B",
      "text": "Aquí? Hier? An der Akademie?[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "kizuna_language_d_08b",
      "hash64": "F9F39C0FC76634FE",
      "text": "Avec moi? Meinst du das ernst? Seriously?[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "kizuna_language_d_09",
      "hash64": "C7790865D9074E1B",
      "text": "Ja, du hast recht... Ich schätze, es könnte einfach\\nhier bei mir bleiben![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "kizuna_language_d_10",
      "hash64": "C77C0565D9097ED9",
      "text": "Ich war so fokussiert darauf, es für seine Rückkehr\\nin die Wildnis aufzupäppeln, dass mir das gar\\r\\nnicht in den Sinn gekommen ist.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 132,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "kizuna_language_d_11",
      "hash64": "C77C0465D9097D26",
      "text": "Pamo, was hältst du von dieser Idee?[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "kizuna_language_d_poke_03",
      "hash64": "9D5A164D2E32E64B",
      "text": "...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "kizuna_language_d_poke_04",
      "hash64": "9D5A1B4D2E32EECA",
      "text": "Pamo!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "kizuna_language_d_12",
      "hash64": "C77C0365D9097B73",
      "text": "Pamo! Es... Es hat gesprochen!![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "kizuna_language_d_13",
      "hash64": "C77C0265D90979C0",
      "text": "Auch ohne die Sprache der Pokémon zu\\nverstehen, war das ein ganz klares „Yes“![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "kizuna_language_d_14",
      "hash64": "C77C0965D90985A5",
      "text": "Muchas gracias, [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0506,0000)]lieberliebe [VAR 0x0100(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0506",
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "kizuna_language_d_16",
      "hash64": "C77C0765D909823F",
      "text": "Als Dankeschön hab ich etwas für dich.\\c\\nDu hast bestimmt Interesse daran, ein seltenes\\nPokémon zu trainieren, nicht wahr?[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 123,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "kizuna_language_d_system_02",
      "hash64": "652DA48DF72792D4",
      "text": "Du erhältst ein Mauzi von Señor Salvatore!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "kizuna_language_d_15",
      "hash64": "C77C0865D90983F2",
      "text": "Ich freue mich so! Ich werde mich gut um Pamo\\nkümmern, darauf kannst du dich verlassen![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "kizuna_language_d_system_01",
      "hash64": "652DA78DF72797ED",
      "text": "Señor Salvatore und du versteht euch nun\\nprächtig!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
